# Day folder files

## Naming

`fase-n/<subject>/dia-NN-slug/` with exactly:

- `teoria.md`
- `exercicios.md`
- `gabarito.md`

Subjects: `fisica`, `matematica`, `quimica`, `portugues`, `ingles`.

## `teoria.md`

- Title + **Meta**
- `## Definição` (short)
- `## Exemplos` (up to 2; omit only if not applicable)
- `## Nesta lição` (nav: Teoria / Exercícios / Gabarito)
- `## Mídias` (YouTube first when possible)
- No full exercise lists here

## `exercicios.md`

- Print-first A4: exercise heading + statement + vertical blank space (`<br>` ok)
- No intro callout, no Teoria/Gabarito nav links, no “Espaço para resolução” label
- No long theory blocks

## `gabarito.md`

Per exercise: **Resposta**, **Desenvolvimento**, plus tips / pitfalls / reasoning jumps when useful  
Never fabricate official ITA keys; mark producer-authored material

## Math delimiters (Docsify + KaTeX)

- Inline: `$v = \Delta s / \Delta t$`
- Display: `$$ s = s_0 + vt $$`
- Do **not** use `\(...\)` or `\[...\]` (they render as raw text)

## Images

- Optional folder `media/` inside the day directory
- Reference: `![alt text](media/filename.svg)`
- Prefer SVG for diagrams; PNG/WebP for photos
- No hotlinked third-party images; see `docs/media-policy.md`
- If missing: `<!-- TODO media: description -->` plus chat pendency
